    "A score built from a different selection measures something else, so the two numbers cannot be compared.": {
      "comment": "Health Score — what a self-chosen composition means for comparisons; detail surface only",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Wert aus einer anderen Zusammenstellung misst etwas anderes, deshalb lassen sich die beiden Zahlen nicht vergleichen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A score built from a different selection measures something else, so the two numbers cannot be compared."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een score die op een andere selectie is gebaseerd, meet iets anders. De twee getallen zijn dus niet vergelijkbaar."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "다른 항목 구성으로 만든 점수는 다른 것을 측정하므로 두 수치를 비교할 수 없어요."
