    },
    "At least three different areas of health have to remain, one of them physically measured. Several pillars can describe the same area and then count together as one.": {
      "comment": "Settings → Health Score — the server-enforced lower bound, stated before the decision",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mindestens drei verschiedene Gesundheitsbereiche müssen bleiben, einer davon körperlich gemessen. Mehrere Säulen können denselben Bereich beschreiben und zählen dann zusammen als einer."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At least three different areas of health have to remain, one of them physically measured. Several pillars can describe the same area and then count together as one."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er moeten minstens drie verschillende gezondheidsgebieden overblijven, waarvan één lichamelijk gemeten. Meerdere pijlers kunnen hetzelfde gebied beschrijven en tellen dan samen als één."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "건강 영역이 최소 3개 남아 있어야 하고, 그중 하나는 실제로 측정한 영역이어야 해요. 여러 항목이 같은 영역을 설명할 수 있으며, 이 경우 하나로 함께 계산돼요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
