            "value": "Diesen Wert tragen andere Säulen als letzte Woche, die beiden Zahlen messen also nicht dasselbe. Deshalb steht hier kein Vergleich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other pillars carried the score than last week, so the two numbers are not measuring the same thing. No comparison is shown."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze score is gebaseerd op andere pijlers dan vorige week, dus de twee getallen meten niet hetzelfde. Er wordt geen vergelijking getoond."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "지난주와 다른 항목이 점수를 구성해서 두 수치는 같은 것을 측정하지 않아요. 비교를 표시하지 않아요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
