          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 주소에는 호스트 부분이 없어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app version doesn't know this measurement yet": {
      "comment": "Secondary hint — unknown metric explains itself",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese App-Version kennt diesen Messwert noch nicht"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app version doesn't know this measurement yet"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze versie van de app kent deze meting nog niet"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 앱 버전에서 아직 지원하지 않는 측정값이에요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clears the transcript on this iPhone. Conversations kept on your server stay — delete them under “Past conversations”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das löscht den Verlauf auf diesem iPhone. Unterhaltungen, die auf deinem Server liegen, bleiben erhalten. Die löschst du unter „Frühere Unterhaltungen“."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This clears the transcript on this iPhone. Conversations kept on your server stay. Delete them under “Past conversations”."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hiermee wis je het gesprek op deze iPhone. Gesprekken op je server blijven bewaard. Die verwijder je onder “Eerdere gesprekken”."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 iPhone의 대화 기록이 지워져요. 서버에 저장된 대화는 그대로 남아요. 서버의 대화는 “이전 대화”에서 삭제하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is still being processed. We'll retry automatically.": {
      "comment": "HLError user-facing copy — audit B-2: the server is still finishing the first request that carried this idempotency key.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird noch verarbeitet. Wird automatisch erneut versucht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is still being processed. We'll retry automatically."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit wordt nog verwerkt. We proberen het automatisch opnieuw."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "아직 처리 중이에요. 자동으로 다시 시도할게요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the first week with enough data for a score. There is nothing before it to compare against yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ist die erste Woche mit genug Daten für einen Wert. Davor liegt noch nichts zum Vergleichen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the first week with enough data for a score. There is nothing before it to compare against yet."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit is de eerste week met genoeg gegevens voor een score. Er is nog niets van daarvoor om mee te vergelijken."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "점수를 계산할 만큼 데이터가 쌓인 첫 주예요. 아직 비교할 이전 데이터가 없어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link is shown only once. We can't show it again — copy or share it now. You can always revoke it later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Link wird nur einmal angezeigt. Wir können ihn nicht erneut anzeigen, also kopiere oder teile ihn jetzt. Du kannst ihn später jederzeit widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This link is shown only once. We can't show it again, so copy or share it now. You can always revoke it later."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze link wordt maar één keer getoond. We kunnen hem niet opnieuw tonen, dus kopieer of deel hem nu. Je kunt hem later altijd intrekken."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 링크는 한 번만 표시돼요. 다시 보여 드릴 수 없으니 지금 복사하거나 공유하세요. 나중에 언제든 해지할 수 있어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This month": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Monat"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This month"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze maand"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이번 달"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This relationship can’t be updated right now.": {
      "comment": "Correlation dismissal — no pattern handle available for this pair",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Zusammenhang lässt sich gerade nicht ändern."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This relationship can’t be updated right now."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit verband kan nu niet worden bijgewerkt."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "지금은 이 관계를 업데이트할 수 없어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This relationship is no longer current, so it can’t be updated.": {
      "comment": "Correlation dismissal — the pattern was withdrawn server-side (404)",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Zusammenhang ist nicht mehr aktuell und lässt sich darum nicht ändern."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This relationship is no longer current, so it can’t be updated."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit verband is niet meer actueel en kan daarom niet worden bijgewerkt."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 관계는 더 이상 최신이 아니라서 업데이트할 수 없어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes it from your server on all devices. This can't be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie wird auf deinem Server für alle Geräte entfernt. Das lässt sich nicht rückgängig machen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes it from your server on all devices. This can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hiermee wordt het op al je apparaten van je server verwijderd. Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "서버에서 삭제되어 모든 기기에서 사라져요. 되돌릴 수 없어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This selection contains no pillar that is physically measured. Without a measurement taken on your body the number would only summarise what you record about yourself, so keep at least one measured pillar in the selection.": {
      "comment": "Health Score composition refused — no measured physiological pillar",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Auswahl enthält keine körperlich gemessene Säule. Ohne eine Messung an deinem Körper wäre die Zahl nur eine Zusammenfassung dessen, was du über dich einträgst. Lass deshalb mindestens eine gemessene Säule in der Auswahl."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This selection contains no pillar that is physically measured. Without a measurement taken on your body the number would only summarise what you record about yourself, so keep at least one measured pillar in the selection."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze selectie bevat geen pijler die lichamelijk wordt gemeten. Zonder een meting aan je lichaam zou het getal alleen samenvatten wat je zelf over jezelf vastlegt. Houd dus minstens één gemeten pijler in de selectie."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 선택에는 신체에서 직접 측정하는 항목이 없어요. 몸에서 측정한 값이 없으면 이 수치는 직접 기록한 내용을 요약할 뿐이에요. 측정 항목을 하나 이상 선택해 두세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This selection covers fewer than three different areas of health. A composite built from one or two areas would not be an overall score, only that one area under another name — and several pillars can describe the same area, in which case they count together as one.": {
      "comment": "Health Score composition refused — too few distinct health domains",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Auswahl deckt weniger als drei verschiedene Gesundheitsbereiche ab. Eine Gesamtzahl aus einem oder zwei Bereichen wäre kein Gesundheitswert, sondern nur dieser eine Bereich unter anderem Namen. Außerdem können mehrere Säulen denselben Bereich beschreiben und zählen dann zusammen als einer."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This selection covers fewer than three different areas of health. A composite built from one or two areas would not be an overall score, only that one area under another name. Also, several pillars can describe the same area, in which case they count together as one."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze selectie beslaat minder dan drie verschillende gezondheidsgebieden. Een samengestelde score uit één of twee gebieden is geen totaalscore, maar alleen dat ene gebied onder een andere naam. Ook kunnen meerdere pijlers hetzelfde gebied beschrijven; ze tellen dan samen als één."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 선택은 서로 다른 건강 영역을 세 개 미만으로 다뤄요. 한두 영역으로 만든 종합 점수는 전체 점수가 아니라 그 영역을 다른 이름으로 부르는 것에 불과해요. 또한 여러 항목이 같은 영역을 나타낼 수 있으며, 그런 경우 함께 하나로 계산돼요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server does not appear to be a HealthLog server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Server scheint kein HealthLog-Server zu sein."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This server does not appear to be a HealthLog server."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze server lijkt geen HealthLog-server te zijn."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HealthLog 서버가 아닌 것 같아요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This update can also sync ECGs and mood from Apple Health. Allow access to turn both on.": {
      "comment": "25-01 update-notice card (decision E-2026-08-28)",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Update kann zusätzlich EKGs und Stimmung aus Apple Health synchronisieren. Erlaube den Zugriff, um beides zu aktivieren."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This update can also sync ECGs and mood from Apple Health. Allow access to turn both on."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Met deze update kun je ook ECG's en stemming uit Apple Health synchroniseren. Geef toegang om beide in te schakelen."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이번 업데이트로 Apple Health의 심전도와 기분도 동기화할 수 있어요. 둘 다 켜려면 접근을 허용하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This was changed somewhere else while you were editing. Reopen the screen and make your change again.": {
      "comment": "Error — CU-20 guarded write gave up after repeated 409 conflicts",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das wurde während deiner Bearbeitung an anderer Stelle geändert. Öffne den Bildschirm neu und nimm deine Änderung erneut vor."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This was changed somewhere else while you were editing. Reopen the screen and make your change again."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit is elders gewijzigd terwijl je aan het bewerken was. Open het scherm opnieuw en breng je wijziging nog een keer aan."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "편집하는 동안 다른 곳에서 변경됐어요. 화면을 다시 열고 다시 변경해 주세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
