    "What you write here is sent to your HealthLog server, stored encrypted, and shared with the coach assistant.": {
      "comment": "About-me — privacy footer under the free-text card",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was du hier einträgst, wird an deinen HealthLog-Server gesendet, verschlüsselt gespeichert und dem Coach-Assistenten mitgegeben."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you write here is sent to your HealthLog server, stored encrypted, and shared with the coach assistant."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wat je hier schrijft, wordt naar je HealthLog-server gestuurd, versleuteld bewaard en gedeeld met de coachassistent."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "여기에 쓴 내용은 HealthLog 서버로 전송되어 암호화된 상태로 저장되고, 코치 어시스턴트와 공유돼요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
