            "state": "translated",
            "value": "상관관계 분석에 포함"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "customMetric.editor.correlation.hint": {
      "comment": "CU-35 (3) — correlationEnabled consent on a custom metric. Footer under the toggle. It is a consent to being analysed, so the copy states plainly what switching it on permits and that it can be taken back.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eingeschaltet legt HealthLog die Werte neben deine übrigen Gesundheitsdaten und sucht nach Zusammenhängen. Ausgeschaltet bleibt es beim Erfassen und beim Diagramm."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, HealthLog puts the values next to the rest of your health data and looks for associations. When off, the metric is just logging and a chart."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als dit aan staat, legt HealthLog de waarden naast je andere gezondheidsgegevens en zoekt naar verbanden. Staat het uit, dan blijft het bij vastleggen en een grafiek."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "켜면 HealthLog가 이 값을 나머지 건강 데이터와 함께 놓고 상관관계를 찾아요. 끄면 이 지표는 기록과 차트로만 쓰여요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
