          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beantwoord ze voor de afgelopen twee weken."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "7문항 불안 선별 검사예요. 지난 2주를 기준으로 답해 주세요."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Approved as server wording (Decision 16): nl from server v1.47.0 messages `mentalHealth.instrumentDescription.gad7` (one sentence of it), word for word; ko from server v1.47.0 messages `mentalHealth.instrumentDescription.gad7`, word for word."
