            "value": "계산값: 맥압 %1$lld, 평균 동맥압 %2$lld mmHg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "insights.sameTimeBaseline.info": {
      "comment": "1.4 B2 - steps/energy/distance/flights info sheet: the same-time comparison card",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Karte vergleicht deinen Stand bis zur letzten vollen Stunde mit deinem üblichen Stand zur selben Stunde. Durchgezogen ist heute, gestrichelt dein üblicher Verlauf: für jede Stunde der Median deiner letzten Wochen, kein einzelner echter Tag. Liefert deine Quelle nur Tagessummen, gibt es keinen Vergleich, und die Karte bleibt weg."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The card compares your total up to the last full hour with your usual total at the same hour. The solid line is today, the dashed line your usual course: for each hour the median of your recent weeks, not one real day. If your source only delivers daily totals, there is nothing to compare and the card stays hidden."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De kaart vergelijkt je stand tot het laatste volle uur met je gebruikelijke stand op hetzelfde uur. De doorgetrokken lijn is vandaag, de gestippelde je gebruikelijke verloop: voor elk uur de mediaan van je afgelopen weken, geen echte afzonderlijke dag. Levert je bron alleen dagtotalen, dan is er niets te vergelijken en blijft de kaart weg."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 카드는 마지막 정시까지의 합계를 같은 시각의 평소 합계와 비교해요. 실선은 오늘, 점선은 평소 흐름이에요. 평소 흐름은 실제 하루가 아니라 최근 몇 주의 시간대별 중앙값이에요. 데이터 소스가 일일 합계만 제공하면 비교할 수 없어 카드가 표시되지 않아요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "sleep.chronotype.info": {
      "comment": "1.4 B2 - sleep info sheet: chronotype card terms",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sozialer Jetlag ist der Unterschied zwischen deinem Schlaf an Arbeits- und freien Tagen, wie eine kleine wöchentliche Zeitverschiebung. Die korrigierte Schlafmitte rechnet den Schlaf heraus, den du am Wochenende nachholst. Als freie Tage gelten die Wochenenden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Social jetlag is the gap between your sleep on work days and free days, like a small weekly time-zone shift. The corrected mid-sleep leaves out the sleep you catch up on at the weekend. Weekends count as the free days."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sociale jetlag is het verschil tussen je slaap op werkdagen en vrije dagen, als een kleine wekelijkse tijdverschuiving. Het gecorrigeerde slaapmidden laat de slaap weg die je in het weekend inhaalt. Het weekend telt als vrije dagen."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "사회적 시차는 근무일과 휴일의 수면 차이로, 매주 작은 시간대 이동을 겪는 것과 비슷해요. 보정된 수면 중간점은 주말에 몰아서 자는 수면을 제외해요. 주말을 휴일로 간주해요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "correlations.chip %@ %lld": {
      "comment": "1.4 B2 - correlation card chip: strength word and the days it rests on, e.g. 'Moderat, 23 Tage'. %1$@ = strength, %2$lld = days",
