    "insights.recovery.info.about": {
      "comment": "1.4 B4 — „Was ist das?“ in the (i) sheet of the Insights recovery page.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was dein Wearable über Erholung und Belastung meldet: der Erholungswert, die Tagesbelastung auf ihrer Skala von 0 bis 21 sowie Herzfrequenz und Energieumsatz des Tages. Die Seite zeigt nur, was in den letzten 30 Tagen einen Wert hat, jeweils mit dem letzten Wert und dem Schnitt dieser 30 Tage."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What your wearable reports about recovery and strain: the recovery score, the day strain on its 0 to 21 scale, and the day's heart rate and energy expenditure. The page shows only what has a reading in the last 30 days, each with its latest value and its 30-day average."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wat je wearable over herstel en belasting meldt: de herstelscore, de dagbelasting op de schaal van 0 tot 21, en de hartslag en het energieverbruik van de dag. De pagina toont alleen wat in de afgelopen 30 dagen een waarde heeft, telkens met de laatste waarde en het gemiddelde van die 30 dagen."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "웨어러블이 회복과 부하에 대해 보고하는 내용이에요: 회복 점수, 0~21 척도의 하루 부하, 그날의 심박수와 에너지 소비량. 이 페이지에는 최근 30일 안에 측정값이 있는 항목만 최신 값과 30일 평균과 함께 표시돼요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "insights.subPage.explainer.hrvRmssdTitle": {
      "comment": "1.4 B4 — title of the explainer for heart rate variability measured as RMSSD (WHOOP, Oura).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV als RMSSD"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV as RMSSD"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV als RMSSD"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RMSSD 기준 HRV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "insights.subPage.explainer.hrvRmssdBody": {
      "comment": "1.4 B4 — „Was ist das?“ in the (i) sheet of the HRV page when it shows RMSSD.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RMSSD ist ein Maß der Herzfrequenzvariabilität: Es beschreibt, wie stark die Abstände zwischen aufeinanderfolgenden Herzschlägen schwanken. Wearables wie WHOOP oder Oura messen es meist im Schlaf. Die Werte lassen sich nicht direkt mit der HRV aus Apple Health vergleichen, die anders gerechnet wird. Aussagekräftig ist dein eigener Verlauf."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RMSSD is a measure of heart rate variability: it describes how much the time between consecutive heartbeats varies. Wearables such as WHOOP or Oura usually measure it during sleep. Its values do not compare directly with the HRV from Apple Health, which is calculated differently. What tells you most is your own course over time."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RMSSD is een maat voor hartslagvariabiliteit: het beschrijft hoe sterk de tijd tussen opeenvolgende hartslagen varieert. Wearables zoals WHOOP of Oura meten het meestal tijdens de slaap. De waarden zijn niet direct te vergelijken met de HRV uit Apple Health, die anders wordt berekend. Het meest zegt je eigen verloop."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RMSSD는 심박변이도의 지표로, 연속된 심장 박동 사이의 간격이 얼마나 달라지는지를 나타내요. WHOOP이나 Oura 같은 웨어러블은 보통 수면 중에 측정해요. 이 값은 계산 방식이 달라서 Apple Health의 HRV와 직접 비교할 수 없어요. 가장 많은 것을 알려 주는 건 시간에 따른 내 변화예요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
