    "life.auditC.offerDue": {
      "comment": "Medical (AUDITC): server wording records.life.auditC.offerDue, shown when the server says the questionnaire is due. Approved as server wording (Decision 16): en from server v1.47.0 messages `records.life.auditC.offerDue`, word for word; nl from server v1.47.0 messages `records.life.auditC.offerDue`, word for word; ko from server v1.47.0 messages `records.life.auditC.offerDue`, word for word.",
