    "life.auditC.notValidated": {
      "comment": "Medical (AUDITC): server wording records.life.auditC.notValidated, shown when the server sends the English original (validatedLocale false). Approved as server wording (Decision 16): en from server v1.47.0 messages `records.life.auditC.notValidated`, word for word; nl from server v1.47.0 messages `records.life.auditC.notValidated`, word for word; ko from server v1.47.0 messages `records.life.auditC.notValidated`, word for word.",
